{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality","kind":"proposition","title":"Markov locality of single Hecke crossings","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-jones-markov-trace","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-non-commutative-probability-dictionary"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality"],"tags":["locality","markov-property","grobner-shirshov","issue-649","established"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation","text":"trace-locality-meets-gs-nonlocality.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality\"></a><p><strong>Markov locality.</strong> For every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x \\in H_n(q)</code>,</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{tr}_{M, n+1}(x \\sigma_n) = z\\, \\mathrm{tr}_{M, n}(x), \\qquad\n  \\mathrm{tr}_{M, n+1}(x \\sigma_n^{-1}) = z_{-}\\, \\mathrm{tr}_{M, n}(x), \\qquad\n  z_{-} = z - (q - q^{-1}).</code></pre>\n<p>A single newly-added crossing contributes a scalar — depending only on the crossing sign — independent of the upstream history.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/trace-locality-meets-gs-nonlocality.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"7.3.7","page":"b/prop-trace-locality-meets-gs-non-locality","qa":{"counts":{"pass":89,"fail":2,"warn":2,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Observations.TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.HasReconciliation","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/TraceLocalityMeetsGsNonLocality.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
